{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"综合能源","country":"西班牙","country_iso":"ESP","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:17:30.774564","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"ESP-HB-0004","ldc":"No","location":"阿拉贡","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"西班牙加列戈700MW工业自用系统","project_name_en":"Spain 700MW Industrial Self-use System (Gallego)","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"西中理事会","content":"日前，西班牙Forestalia和中国绿色能源公司（CGE）签署了一项协议，将建立西班牙最大的工业自用系统，初始投资额为10亿 。两家公司都承诺安装一个700MW 的绿色平台，可扩展至1000MW。\n该项目第一阶段将于2025年至2026年间建设，目标是在2027年至2028年完工。该项目所需的许可证已处于高级审批阶段 ，其中包括与该计划的环境影响相关的许可证。\n该协议由 Forestalia 风能和太阳能开发首席执行官费尔南多·桑佩尔·加西亚（Fernando Samper García）和 CGE International 负责人 Cui Can 在 西班牙加列戈新镇（Villanueva de Gállego）举行的 Sella 论坛框架内签署 。签字仪式由阿拉贡政府总统豪尔赫·阿兹康（Jorge Azcón）主持。\n据悉该项目除了保证阿拉贡地区风能、光伏和电池能源的混合动力外，还将促进工业自用，从而有利于吸引阿拉贡企业。最后一个因素在该地区也是前所未有的。","content_sha256":"d78a24b8670f8af685f63dbe19a4f22b43cca8dc566804a5890342af9a8fb179","id":7809,"publish_date":"2024-07-03 21:28:03","title":"中西携手将投资10亿打造西班牙最大的工业自用系统","title_sha256":"87d12d8fd85bd940a98b33c408387dd8a16cfd70534190f2b126e4ab759e8777","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/67897.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"ESP-HB-0004","capacity_details":"700MW绿色平台，可扩展至1000MW","capacity_mw":700.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"700","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:17:30.774894","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"ESP-HB-0004-01","investment_date":"2024-07-01","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.investinspain.org/content/icex-invest/zh/index/news-main/2024/forestalia.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"2028-01-01","planned_start_date":"2025-01-01","production_capacity_unit":null,